00:00:23,599 --> 00:00:28,135
changed anything, whether you had three
hypotheses or one, whether the forced push

6
00:00:28,175 --> 00:00:32,599
named what it expected, or whether your
message to the CTO claimed something you

7
00:00:32,639 --> 00:00:36,450
never checked. Today you read your
own work the way a reviewer would.

8
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:40,523
That's harder than doing the work was.
Hold on to the question on screen.

9
00:00:40,563 --> 00:00:42,811
You'll answer it yourself before the end.

10
00:00:44,651 --> 00:00:48,305
Welcome back to Git and GitHub
Deep Mastery. Pull up a chair.

11
00:00:48,345 --> 00:00:53,149
This video is watched only after all eight
stages of the capstone are handed in.

12
00:00:53,189 --> 00:00:57,933
If a stage is still open, or its deliverables
aren't written, please stop here.

13
00:01:00,273 --> 00:01:05,202
The model replays are shown from this point
on, and a retake after watching them is

14
00:01:05,242 --> 00:01:09,991
