debugging ability for a stage at level 3

15
00:01:10,031 --> 00:01:12,086
once its walkthrough has been read.

16
00:01:12,426 --> 00:01:17,215
The debrief has one rule, taken from the
evaluator's notes: the model solution is

17
00:01:17,255 --> 00:01:22,102
one route. A different route that is
