18
00:01:22,142 --> 00:01:25,977
So you don't compare your commands
with the model's for sameness.

19
00:01:26,017 --> 00:01:30,865
You compare them for safety. For each stage
I show one or two moments of the model

20
00:01:30,905 --> 00:01:35,633
replay, the moments on which the stage
turns, and you look for the corresponding

21
00:01:35,673 --> 00:01:37,541
