22
00:01:37,881 --> 00:01:42,012
Before each stage's replay you fill
in your own scores for that stage.

23
00:01:42,052 --> 00:01:43,681
Score what you can point at.

24
00:01:45,521 --> 00:01:47,099
Here's what you'll walk away with.

25
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:48,851
After this video you can:

26
00:01:49,191 --> 00:01:53,236
Score your own deliverables on the seven
dimensions with the four-level scale.

27
00:01:53,576 --> 00:01:57,598
Compare your recovery path with the
model path for safety, not for sameness.

28
00:01:57,938 --> 00:02:02,092
Find the stage where your evidence log was
thinnest and say what you would collect

29
00:02:02,132 --> 00:02:02,297
now.

30
00:02:02,637 --> 00:02:05,645
Name the control each stage
should have left behind.

31
00:02:05,985 --> 00:02:09,175
State what you would do differently
in a real incident tomorrow.

32
00:02:11,015 --> 00:02:15,846
What is evaluated. Three sources, and
nothing else: the eight check results, the

33
00:02:15,886 --> 00:02:19,864
stage files with their seven items
each, and the final postmortem.

34
00:02:20,204 --> 00:02:24,762
The scale. Every dimension is scored
once per stage in which it applies.

35
00:02:25,102 --> 00:02:29,754
Level 3 is the standard. Level 4 is what
distinguishes someone who can lead the

36
00:02:29,794 --> 00:02:32,189
incident from someone who can resolve it.

37
00:02:32,529 --> 00:02:37,257
The seven dimensions, and where their
evidence is. Git knowledge: the root-cause

38
00:02:37,297 --> 00:02:41,667
item of every stage and the commands
in the evidence log and the recovery.

39
00:02:41,707 --> 00:02:46,674
GitHub knowledge: the "equivalent on GitHub"
notes, the prevention item and the "Not

40
00:02:46,714 --> 00:02:49,832
verified" lists. Debugging
ability: the evidence log.

41
00:02:49,872 --> 00:02:54,660
Production judgment: the options table,
your answers to the shortcuts proposed in

42
00:02:54,700 --> 00:02:59,666
the briefings, and the severity. Security
awareness: all of the leaked-secret stage,

43
00:02:59,706 --> 00:03:03,064
every forced push, the workflow
reading. Recovery skills.

44
00:03:03,104 --> 00:03:07,713
Engineering communication: the two messages
